T1  - A Mixture of T-Cell Epitope Peptides Derived from Human Respiratory Syncytial Virus F Protein Conferred Protection in DR1-TCR Tg Mice.
T3  - Erratum in: Vaccines (Basel). 2025 Apr 08;13(4):394. doi: 10.3390/vaccines13040394. PMID: 40333287 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40333287]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3390/vaccines12010077
A1  - Guo, Hong
A1  - Song, Yang
A1  - Li, Hai
A1  - Hu, Hongqiao
A1  - Shi, Yuqing
A1  - Jiang, Jie
