T1  - A swarm-optimization based fusion model of sentiment analysis for cryptocurrency price prediction.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/s41598-025-92563-y
A1  - Tiwari, Dimple
A1  - Bhati, Bhoopesh Singh
A1  - Nagpal, Bharti
