T1  - Use of Multiple Pharmacodynamic Measures to Deconstruct the Nix-TB Regimen in a Short-Course Murine Model of Tuberculosis.
T3  - Update in: Antimicrob Agents Chemother. 2024 May 2;68(5):e0101023. doi: 10.1128/aac.01010-23. PMID: 38501805 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38501805]
