T1  - Mast cell activation signature as a potential biomarker in COVID-19.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.imlet.2025.107026
A1  - Meneses-Preza, Yatsiri G
A1  - Soria-Castro, Rodolfo
A1  - Alfaro-Doblado, Angel R
A1  - Hernandez-Solis, Alejandro
A1  - Alvarez-Maldonado, Pablo
A1  - Gomez-Martin, Diana
A1  - Torres-Ruiz, Jiram
A1  - Munoz-Valle, Jose Francisco
A1  - Munoz-Rios, Guillermina
A1  - Hernandez-Ramirez, Cristian Oswaldo
A1  - Guemes-Gonzalez, Azmavet M
A1  - Wong-Baeza, Isabel
A1  - Maravillas-Montero, Jose Luis
