T1  - Study on the impact of meteorological factors on influenza in different periods and prediction based on artificial intelligence RF-Bi-LSTM algorithm: to compare the COVID-19 period with the non-COVID-19 period.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12879-024-09750-x
A1  - Zhu, Hansong
A1  - Chen, Si
A1  - Qin, Weixia
