T1  - Accuracy of glomerular filtration rate estimation using creatinine and cystatin C for identifying and monitoring moderate chronic kidney disease: the eGFR-C study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3310/HYHN1078
A1  - Lamb, Edmund J
A1  - Barratt, Jonathan
A1  - Brettell, Elizabeth A
