T1  - Use of multiple pharmacodynamic measures to deconstruct the Nix-TB regimen in a short-course murine model of tuberculosis.
T3  - Update of: bioRxiv. 2023 Nov 11:2023.11.08.566205. doi: 10.1101/2023.11.08.566205. PMID: 37986955 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37986955]
