T1  - A regionally tailored epidemiological forecast and monitoring program to guide a healthcare system in the COVID-19 pandemic.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jiph.2024.04.014
A1  - Turk, Philip J
A1  - Anderson, William E
A1  - Burns, Ryan J
