T1  - Virus-like particle-mediated delivery of structure-selected neoantigens demonstrates immunogenicity and antitumoral activity in mice.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12967-023-04843-8
A1  - Barajas, Ana
A1  - Amengual-Rigo, Pep
A1  - Pons-Grifols, Anna
