T1  - A systematic review of the data, methods and environmental covariates used to map Aedes-borne arbovirus transmission risk.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12879-023-08717-8
A1  - Lim, Ah-Young
A1  - Jafari, Yalda
A1  - Caldwell, Jamie M
