T1  - Understanding and combatting misinformation across 16 countries on six continents.
T3  - Erratum in: Nat Hum Behav. 2023 Oct;7(10):1797. doi: 10.1038/s41562-023-01676-9 PMID: 37463989 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37463989]
