T1  - Prognostic nomogram for patients with advanced unresectable hepatocellular carcinoma treated with TAE combined with HAIC.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3389/fphar.2024.1426912
A1  - Du, Li-Xin
A1  - Sheng, Guo-Li
