T1  - COVID-19 transmission dynamics and the impact of vaccination: modelling, analysis and simulations.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1098/rsos.221656
A1  - Malinzi, Joseph
A1  - Juma, Victor Ogesa
A1  - Madubueze, Chinwendu Emilian
