T1  - Potential impacts of prolonged absence of influenza virus circulation on subsequent epidemics.
T3  - Update in: Nat Commun. 2024 Jan 18;15(1):591. doi: 10.1038/s41467-023-44668-z PMID: 38238318 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38238318]
