T1  - Health belief model and behavioural practice of urban poor towards COVID-19 in Nigeria.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.heliyon.2021.e08037
A1  - Adesina, Evaristus
A1  - Oyero, Olusola
A1  - Amodu, Lanre
