T1  - Quercetin and/or Ascorbic Acid Modulatory Effect on Phenobarbital-Induced Sleeping Mice Possibly through GABAA and GABAB Receptor Interaction Pathway.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3390/ph14080721
A1  - Hossain, Rajib
A1  - Al-Khafaji, Khattab
A1  - Khan, Rasel Ahmed
A1  - Sarkar, Chandan
A1  - Islam, Md Shahazul
