T1  - Estimating PM2.5 concentrations via random forest method using satellite, auxiliary, and ground-level station dataset at multiple temporal scales across China in 2017.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.scitotenv.2021.146288
A1  - Guo, Bin
A1  - Zhang, Dingming
A1  - Pei, Lin
A1  - Su, Yi
