T1  - Demonstrating multi-country calibration of a tuberculosis model using new history matching and emulation package - hmer.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.epidem.2023.100678
A1  - Scarponi, Danny
A1  - Iskauskas, Andrew
A1  - Clark, Rebecca A
A1  - Vernon, Ian
A1  - McKinley, Trevelyan J
