T1  - Characterizing changes in behaviors associated with chemical exposures during the COVID-19 pandemic.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0277679
A1  - Herbstman, Julie B
A1  - Romano, Megan E
A1  - Li, Xiuhong
