T1  - Autologous Shuffling Lipo-Aspirated Fat Combined Mechanical Stretch in Revision Rhinoplasty for Severe Contractures in Asian Patients.
T3  - Erratum in: Aesthetic Plast Surg. 2023 Feb;47(1):502. doi: 10.1007/s00266-022-02995-4 PMID: 35794245 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35794245] Comment in: Aesthetic Plast Surg. 2023 Feb;47(1):292-293. doi: 10.1007/s00266-022-03175-0 PMID: 36510019 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/36510019]
