T1  - A 29-MRNA HOST RESPONSE WHOLE-BLOOD SIGNATURE IMPROVES PREDICTION OF 28-DAY MORTALITY AND 7-DAY INTENSIVE CARE UNIT CARE IN ADULTS PRESENTING TO THE EMERGENCY DEPARTMENT WITH SUSPECTED ACUTE INFECTION AND/OR SEPSIS.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1097/SHK.0000000000001970
A1  - Kostaki, Antigone
A1  - Wacker, James W
A1  - Safarika, Asimina
A1  - Solomonidi, Nicky
A1  - Katsaros, Konstantinos
A1  - Giannikopoulos, George
A1  - Koutelidakis, Ioannis M
A1  - Hogan, Catherine A
