T1  - Comparing human and model-based forecasts of COVID-19 in Germany and Poland.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1010405
A1  - Bosse, Nikos I
A1  - Abbott, Sam
A1  - Bracher, Johannes
