T1  - Site-Level Comprehensiveness of Care Is Associated with Individual Clinical Retention Among Adults Living with HIV in International Epidemiology Databases to Evaluate AIDS, a Global HIV Cohort Collaboration, 2000-2016.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1089/apc.2022.0042
A1  - Wada, Paul Y
A1  - Kim, Ahra
A1  - Jayathilake, Karu
A1  - Duda, Stephany N
A1  - Abo, Yao
