T1  - Increase in serum choline levels predicts for improved progression-free survival (PFS) in patients with advanced cancers receiving pembrolizumab.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/jitc-2021-004378
A1  - Watson, Geoffrey Alan
