T1  - Developmental artificial neural network model to evaluate the preoperative safe limit of future liver remnant volume for HCC combined with clinically significant portal hypertension.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.2217/fon-2021-1297
A1  - Lu, Hua-Ze
A1  - Mai, Rong-Yun
A1  - Wang, Xiao-Bo
A1  - Chen, Jie
A1  - Bai, Tao
