T1  - Characterising acute kidney injury: The complementary roles of biomarkers of renal stress and renal function.
T3  - Comment in: J Crit Care. 2023 Feb;73:154212. doi: 10.1016/j.jcrc.2022.154212 PMID: 36368177 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/36368177]
