T1  - It Ain't Over 'Til It's Over: SARS CoV-2 and Post-infectious Gastrointestinal Dysmotility.
T3  - Comment in: Dig Dis Sci. 2023 Jan;68(1):333-334. doi: 10.1007/s10620-022-07752-w PMID: 36414842 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/36414842]
