T1  - Chest Radiograph Scoring Alone or Combined with Other Risk Scores for Predicting Outcomes in COVID-19.
T3  - Comment in: Radiology. 2022 Feb;302(2):470-472. doi: 10.1148/radiol.2021212212 PMID: 34519581 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34519581] Erratum in: Radiology. 2021 Dec;301(3):E444. doi: 10.1148/radiol.2021219021 PMID: 34807774 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34807774] Erratum in: Radiology. 2022 Feb;302(2):E11. doi: 10.1148/radiol.219029 PMID: 35073202 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35073202]
