T1  - Trade-offs between individual and ensemble forecasts of an emerging infectious disease.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/s41467-021-25695-0
A1  - Oidtman, Rachel J
A1  - Omodei, Elisa
A1  - Kraemer, Moritz U G
