T1  - A method for the rational selection of drug repurposing candidates from multimodal knowledge harmonization.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/s41598-021-90296-2
A1  - Schultz, Bruce
A1  - Zaliani, Andrea
A1  - Ebeling, Christian
A1  - Reinshagen, Jeanette
