T1  - Early life predictors of positive change during the coronavirus disease pandemic.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s40359-021-00586-7
A1  - Bleil, Maria E
A1  - Appelhans, Bradley M
A1  - Thomas, Alexis S
A1  - Gregorich, Steven E
