T1  - Risk factors for the critical illness in SARS-CoV-2 infection: a multicenter retrospective cohort study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12931-020-01492-z
A1  - Cheng, Sijing
A1  - Wu, Dingfeng
A1  - Li, Jie
