T1  - Accuracy of real-time multi-model ensemble forecasts for seasonal influenza in the U.S.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1007486
A1  - Reich, Nicholas G
A1  - McGowan, Craig J
A1  - Yamana, Teresa K
A1  - Tushar, Abhinav
A1  - Ray, Evan L
A1  - Osthus, Dave
A1  - Kandula, Sasikiran
A1  - Brooks, Logan C
A1  - Crawford-Crudell, Willow
