T1  - Bacterial Factors That Predict Relapse after Tuberculosis Therapy.
T3  - Comment in: N Engl J Med. 2018 Aug 30;379(9):882-883. doi: 10.1056/NEJMe1808564 PMID: 30157402 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30157402] Comment in: N Engl J Med. 2019 Jan 10;380(2):197. doi: 10.1056/NEJMc1813645 PMID: 30628424 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30628424]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1056/NEJMoa1715849
A1  - Colangeli, Roberto
A1  - Jedrey, Hannah
A1  - Kim, Soyeon
A1  - Connell, Roy
A1  - Ma, Shuyi
A1  - Chippada Venkata, Uma D
