T1  - Development and validation of a gene expression-based signature to predict distant metastasis in locoregionally advanced nasopharyngeal carcinoma: a retrospective, multicentre, cohort study.
T3  - Comment in: Lancet Oncol. 2018 Mar;19(3):278-280. doi: 10.1016/S1470-2045(18)30085-8 PMID: 29428164 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/29428164]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S1470-2045(18)30080-9
A1  - Tang, Xin-Ran
A1  - Li, Ying-Qin
A1  - Liang, Shao-Bo
