T1  - Evaluation of discriminative capacity of two formulas of CKD-EPI to predict complications after the first episode of heart failure with preserved ejection fraction.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.2147/IJNRD.S196976
A1  - Shchekochikhin, Dmitry
A1  - Nikiforova, Tatiana
A1  - Shilova, Alexandra
A1  - Nesterov, Alexey
A1  - Baturina, Olga
