T1  - Microbiological and functional outcomes after open extremity fractures sustained overseas: The experience of a UK level I trauma centre.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jpra.2017.09.003
A1  - Ardehali, B
A1  - Geoghegan, L
A1  - Khajuria, A
A1  - Reissis, D
