T1  - The Utility of Inflammatory and Endothelial Markers to Identify Infection in Emergency Department Patients.
T3  - Comment in: Shock. 2016 Jul;46(1):108-9. doi: 10.1097/SHK.0000000000000583 PMID: 26849626 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26849626] Comment in: Shock. 2016 Jul;46(1):108. doi: 10.1097/SHK.0000000000000582 PMID: 26849627 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26849627]
