T1  - Performance of creatinine and cystatin C-based glomerular filtration rate estimating equations in a European HIV-positive cohort.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1097/QAD.0b013e32835fac30
A1  - Gagneux-Brunon, Amandine
A1  - Delanaye, Pierre
A1  - Maillard, Nicolas
