T1  - Clostridium difficile ribotype does not predict severe infection.
T3  - Comment in: Clin Infect Dis. 2012 Dec;55(12):1669-72. doi: 10.1093/cid/cis790 PMID: 22972865 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/22972865] Comment in: Clin Infect Dis. 2013 Mar;56(6):906-7. doi: 10.1093/cid/cis1001 PMID: 23196956 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23196956] Comment in: Clin Infect Dis. 2013 Mar;56(6):907-8. doi: 10.1093/cid/cis1003 PMID: 23196958 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23196958] Comment in: Clin Infect Dis. 2013 Jun;56(12):1845-6. doi: 10.1093/cid/cit098 PMID: 23420817 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23420817] Comment in: Clin Infect Dis. 2013 Jun;56(12):1846-7. doi: 10.1093/cid/cit099 PMID: 23420819 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23420819]
